  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">這個簡單的 Minecraft 模組在平原和櫻花樹林生物群系中添加了一輛亞洲美食餐車。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">裡面可以找到村民浩（ヒロ）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">該模組還引入了兩種新的食物物品：鮭魚握壽司和白蘿蔔。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/357/food-cart.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/360/new-food.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"379\" height=\"213\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>歡迎在您的整合包中使用此模組</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">美食餐車建造教學：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:417px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hUZ6QkDKZz4\" width=\"417\" height=\"242\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
